<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ahmsa started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ahmsa started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it had started coverage of Mexican steelmaker Altos Hornos de Mexico SA, or Ahmsa, with a rating of accumulate for the intermediate term and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Ahmsa &quot;is already a low-cost producer and completion of its current capital program should reduce costs materially more,&quot; the firm said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Furthermore, the recovering Mexican economy should permit Ahmsa to significantly raise the proportion of sales to the higher margined domestic market.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The analysis added, &quot;In sum, we view Ahmsa as an aggressive, leveraged vehicle for exposure to the Mexican economic recovery.&quot;</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
